ycqlsh> select i,j,k,l from k.hn where j=11123;
InvalidRequest: Error from server: code=2200 [Invalid query] message="Wrong Metadata Version. schema version mismatch for table 01576d05a93345788d4a7facb654ab7e: expected 226, got 225
select i,j,k,l from k.hn where j=11123;
^^^^^^
